        see:a code search stands as a spine — every file a vertebra behind the head and every crowded file folded to a few ribs
        see:a re-search re-forms the creature in the same world — the head morphs to the new query
        see:a crest presses like its members — the expedition goes down into the file narrowed to that kind
        see:a region opens from the file — its own methods become the vertebrae with their hits as ribs
        see:a method opens as a chamber — its paragraphs are vertebrae and its own source lines are the ribs
        see:a line that calls another method is a tunnel — pressing it lands in that method chamber
        see:the head is the rope — pressing it climbs one level and the region returns
